# Project-specific R8 keep rules.
#
# AGP combines every keep rule file placed under src/main/keepRules
# (see rules.keep) and passes them to R8 automatically -- no proguardFiles()
# wiring is needed in build.gradle.kts. Note: AGP 9 requires these files to
# use the .keep extension (not .pro) when placed in this directory.
#
# Most of this app's third-party dependencies (Retrofit, Gson 2.11+, Room,
# Hilt, Coil, CameraX, ML Kit) ship their own consumer keep rules inside
# their AARs, so they don't need entries here. See
#   https://d.android.com/r/tools/r8/keep-rules

# --- Gson (NHTSA VIN decoder network responses) ---
# Gson's bundled consumer rules already protect @SerializedName fields, but
# these DTOs cross a network boundary, so we pin them down explicitly as a
# defense-in-depth measure against silent (de)serialization breakage.
-keepclassmembers class com.fearmikey.garage.data.remote.dto.** {
    <fields>;
    <init>(...);
}

# --- Readable stack traces ---
# Keep source file + line number info so obfuscated stack traces captured in
# Logcat/bug reports can still be mapped back to real source locations.
-keepattributes SourceFile, LineNumberTable
